# A Router Advertisement with an option of length zero (RFC 4861 section 4.6: a node silently
# discards the message, and a walk that trusted the length would never advance).
#
86 00 1a 2b
40 00 07 08
00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00
# option 1 with length 0, then the octets the address would have been
01 00 00 00 5e 00 53 01
